> xor_not_A(a: bool, b: bool) = !(a xor b)
> xor_not_B(a: bool, b: bool) = a xor !b
> equiv xor_not_A ~ xor_not_B
xor_not_A and xor_not_B are equal on the domain of xor_not_A (exhaustive)
> xnor_eq_A(a: bool, b: bool) = !(a xor b)
> xnor_eq_B(a: bool, b: bool) = a == b
> equiv xnor_eq_A ~ xnor_eq_B
xnor_eq_A and xnor_eq_B are equal on the domain of xnor_eq_A (exhaustive)
> consensus_A(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a & b) | (!a & c)
> consensus_B(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a & b) | (!a & c) | (b & c)
> equiv consensus_A ~ consensus_B
consensus_A and consensus_B are equal on the domain of consensus_A (exhaustive)
> maj_alt_A(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a & b) | (a & c) | (b & c)
> maj_alt_B(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a & b) | (c & (a xor b))
> equiv maj_alt_A ~ maj_alt_B
maj_alt_A and maj_alt_B are equal on the domain of maj_alt_A (exhaustive)
> maj_comm_A(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (a & b) | (a & c) | (b & c)
> maj_comm_B(a: bool, b: bool, c: bool) = (b & a) | (b & c) | (a & c)
> equiv maj_comm_A ~ maj_comm_B
maj_comm_A and maj_comm_B are equal on the domain of maj_comm_A (exhaustive)
> mux_andor_A(c: bool, a: bool, b: bool) = c ? a : b
> mux_andor_B(c: bool, a: bool, b: bool) = (c & a) | (!c & b)
> equiv mux_andor_A ~ mux_andor_B
mux_andor_A and mux_andor_B are equal on the domain of mux_andor_A (exhaustive)
> mux_andor2_A(c: bool, a: bool, b: bool) = c ? a : b
> mux_andor2_B(c: bool, a: bool, b: bool) = (b & !c) | (a & c)
> equiv mux_andor2_A ~ mux_andor2_B
mux_andor2_A and mux_andor2_B are equal on the domain of mux_andor2_A (exhaustive)
> mux_true_A(c: bool, d: bool) = c ? c : d
> mux_true_B(c: bool, d: bool) = c | d
> equiv mux_true_A ~ mux_true_B
mux_true_A and mux_true_B are equal on the domain of mux_true_A (exhaustive)
